<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>A[Start]<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>B[Configure<sp/>GPIO<sp/>pins<sp/>for<sp/>I2C<sp/>communication]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>B<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>C[Initialize<sp/>system<sp/>control<sp/>and<sp/>PIE<sp/>control<sp/>registers]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>C<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>D[Register<sp/>the<sp/>I2C<sp/>interrupt<sp/>service<sp/>routine]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>D<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>E[Initialize<sp/>I2C<sp/>module<sp/>in<sp/>target<sp/>mode<sp/>using<sp/>I2CTarget_Init]</highlight></codeline>
