<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>The<sp/>RX<sp/>buffer<sp/>is<sp/>reinitialized<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>non-zero<sp/>value<sp/>(`0xBAAD`)<sp/>after<sp/>successful<sp/>data<sp/>comparison.</highlight></codeline>
